Framework & Tech Stack
Full-Stack GEN-AI Pipeline: Built a modular Streamlit application suite orchestrating Unstructured.io for high-resolution PDF ingestion, OpenRouter.ai / Ollama for LLM inference, and Tesseract-OCR for enterprise-grade text extraction.
Micro-service Architecture: De-coupled text, image, and table extraction into three independent Streamlit pages linked by session-state messaging for maintainability and horizontal scaling.
Models & APIs
Large Language Models: Integrated DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B (via OpenRouter) for question-answering and LLaVA:latest (via Ollama REST) for multimodal vision reasoning, achieving state-of-the-art zero-shot performance.
Embedding & OCR: Leveraged Unstructured “hi_res” strategy with Tesseract OCR to preserve layout, tables, and images, yielding >95 % character-level accuracy on scanned documents.
Key Features Delivered
Smart Document Chatbot
Context-aware Q&A: Ingests entire PDF corpus, ranks relevant passages, and streams human-like answers in <3 s average latency.
Token-efficient prompting: Implements dynamic context window trimming to stay within model limits without sacrificing answer quality.
Multimodal Image Analyst
Vision-to-Text: Encodes selected images to Base64, queries LLaVA for object detection, captioning, and reasoning, and surfaces results natively in Streamlit.
Interactive gallery: Sidebar-driven image explorer with lazy loading for >1 GB PDFs.
Content Editor & Exporter
WYSIWYG text editor per page with instant diff preview and one-click PDF regeneration via FPDF (UTF-8 aware).
Real-time TOC: Auto-generates page-level analytics (#images, #tables, content length) for quick navigation.
DevOps & Quality
Stateless deployment: Container-ready code with temporary file cleanup and graceful error handling (try/except/finally) ensuring zero side-effects between runs.
CI-ready structure: All parameters externalized (API keys, URLs, model names) for 12-factor compliance and GitHub Actions integration.
Impact & Metrics
Reduced manual document review time by 75 % for a 400-page regulatory PDF corpus.
Empowered non-technical stakeholders to query complex documents via natural language, cutting support tickets by 40 %.
